 ng their Spirit centered work to open the roads into the realm of Spirit\
 , embodying the forces of nature and their journey as culture bearers and
  women of the Diaspora. Rosesharon’s and Nedra’s connectedness is express
 ed through their art & the Love of community they share within the many r
 ealms they inhabit.\n\nJoin us for the opening reception on Saturday\, Ju
 ly 18th from 5-8pm to enjoy fine wine and refreshments\, meet the artists
 \, and groove to mystical music by Sophia Rayne.
