SUMMARY: Wet Paint: Art Show with Jonny Hirschmugl
DESCRIPTION:"This showing is a perspective on the retrospective\; sort of
 ."\n\nJonny Hirschmugl is a painter\, builder\, and a main character in t
 his satire of life. In all his creative endeavors\, his main qualities ar
 e ever present: nostalgic\, romantic\, & delusional.\n\nA Petaluma native
 \, his art is influenced by the riverscape story of this town. Buried in 
 the iron facades of downtown's structures\, to the labyrinth sewers below
 . And the heritage farmlands\, with forgotten tales\, that only the raven
 s can recite so well.\n\nJonny has exhibited his paintings in gallery sho
 ws and various markets for the last 17 years. His murals can be seen thro
 ughout Petaluma\, and spanning to nearby places in Sonoma County.
CATEGORIES:artshow,coworking,jonnyhirshmugl,kellerstreetcowork
