SUMMARY: Join us at Brooks Note Winery for a special event celebrating Sa
 ve Sight Now
DESCRIPTION:Join us at Brooks Note Winery for a special event celebrating
  Save Sight Now - an organization dedicated to curing childhood blindness
  caused by Usher syndrome\, the leading cause of combined deaf-blindness.
 \n\nLearn about the global impact of Save Sight Now and the groundbreakin
 g research they are funding to preserve and restore children's sight. Adm
 ission is $40 (includes wine and charcuterie)\, and our silent auction of
 fers incredible items. Together\, let's raise awareness\, funds\, and spi
 rits to help create a world where no child suffers from preventable blind
 ness.
CATEGORIES:winery,fundraiser
