SUMMARY: Caesar is coming to Life on Art - FREE Performances
DESCRIPTION:Caesar is coming to Life on Art - FREE Performances\n\nWe're 
 thrilled to host a timely\, stripped-down modern production of one of Sha
 kespeare's most political plays. Tight 95-minute run\, no intermission\, 
 no fluff — just the drama.\n\nDoors open one hour before performance with
  a hosted bar and snacks. Performances Friday and Saturday at 7:30pm and 
 last chance of the season on Sunday at 3pm\n\nAugust 14 at 7:30 pm\, Augu
 st 15 at 7:30pm\, August 16 at 3pm performance\n\nLife on Art\, 133 Copel
 and St\, Petaluma\n\nFree tickets on Eventbrite: https://www.eventbrite.c
 om/.../jacobethan-theatre... https://www.eventbrite.com/o/jacobethan-thea
 tre-workshop-67618588843?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExQnh0VWVVNGhEeVd
