SUMMARY: Wine & Wisdom: Author Conversation with Tanya Thompson
DESCRIPTION:Join us on Thursday\, July 30th from 6-8pm as we explore the 
 stories shaping what we believe is possible - and how one seemingly small
  shift in perspective can move us toward a life beyond the vision board. 
 📖\n\nFor anyone who has ever looked at a vision board and felt a quiet w
 hisper that something was missing\, this book is your answer.\nBeyond the
  Vision Board offers a lifeline out of static dreaming and into dynamic b
 ecoming.\n\nAuthor Tanya Thompson seamlessly weaves neuroscience\, storyt
 elling\, and timeless wisdom into The Storyboard Method™—a practical and 
 profound process for mapping your life as a story in motion. 🌟\n\nYou wi
 ll discover how to use image and narrative together to reprogram your bra
 in\, align with your core values\, and navigate the inner barriers that s
 tand between you and your preferred reality.\n\nThis is more than a book\
 ; it's an experience that will equip you with the tools to finally bridge
  the gap between the life you have and the life you know you are meant to
  be living. Your new story is waiting to be boarded.
CATEGORIES:
