SUMMARY: Art-Making at Life On Art - Every Sunday
DESCRIPTION:Join us every Sunday 1-3pm at Life on Art gallery in Petaluma
 . We're creating art to provide support for our programs - creating heali
 ng through art. Get messy making a paper mache heart\, enjoy the gallery 
 and take in the art and the heartstories or see the works of one of our r
 esident artists. Lots to see and do at Life on Art - drop ins welcome\, f
 ree and fun for all ages.
