SUMMARY: The Year of the Horses Art Show
DESCRIPTION:The horse has carried symbolic weight across cultures for cen
 turies - a creature that embodies freedom and strength\, loyalty and wild
 ness\, grace and endurance. It felt like the perfect spirit to gather aro
 und.\n\nJoin us Saturday\, August 15th\, from 5 - 8pm at Pennyroyal Desig
 n in downtown Petaluma for an evening celebrating art\, craftsmanship\, a
 nd all things equestrian.\n\nArtist Françoise LeClerc will debut a new co
 llection of cyanotype prints and equestrian-inspired sculptures - work th
 at explores strength\, vulnerability\, and the quiet connection between h
 orse and human.\n\nSacred Order will present a special collection of hors
 e-inspired jewelry\, featuring new original designs alongside thoughtfull
 y curated antique pieces. Wendy's newest horse-themed T-shirt will also m
 ake its debut\, perfectly complementing the evening's collection.\n\nWe'l
 l also be unveiling Pennyroyal's first small collection of men's goods - 
 a new chapter we're excited to share.\n\nWe hope you'll join us as we cel
 ebrate the beauty\, symbolism\, and enduring spirit of the horse.
CATEGORIES:art,jewelry,shopping,gallery
