SUMMARY: Theatre District Summer Concert Series – Cathie Poncia
DESCRIPTION:Theatre District is thrilled to announce the return of its Su
 mmer Concert Series for 2026. Beginning in June and running through Septe
 mber\, the series features free live music every Friday from 6:00 PM to 8
 :00 PM in downtown Petaluma. The concert series brings together local tal
 ent and diverse musical styles\, creating a vibrant community gathering i
 n the heart of the Theatre District.\n\nCathie Poncia https://www.faceboo
 k.com/cathieponciaandfriends/ is performing from 6:00 to 8:00 in Theatre 
 Square. We hope to see you there!\n\nCathie Poncia performs a wide range 
 of genres\, including swing\, Latin\, jazz\, blues\, country\, and ballad
 s. Their repertoire spans from the 1940s to today\, making their shows fe
 el both timeless and fresh. They offer customized performances for privat
 e and public events such as weddings and receptions. Known for their soul
 ful sound and engaging presence\, they bring warmth and charm to every st
 age they play.
