SUMMARY: 2026 Petaluma River Craft Beer Festival
DESCRIPTION:Discounted early bird tickets are now on sale until July 1 fo
 r the 12th annual Petaluma River Craft Beer Festival Saturday\, September
  12 from 1-5 p.m. in historic downtown Petaluma where attendees can enjoy
  craft beer tastings from two dozen regional breweries\, delicious food f
 rom several of Petaluma’s top restaurants and live music from local bands
 .\n\nGeneral admission includes beer glass\, beer tastings and live music
 . Limited reduced price “designated driver” tickets are also available fo
 r $25 and include snacks\, nonalcoholic beverages and a $10 gift certific
 ate for event food purchases. This is a 21-and-over event (no children or
  babies) and animals are not allowed. ID is required at the gate\, which 
 will be located at Water Street near the Balshaw Bridge.\n\nHosted by the
  Petaluma Valley and Petaluma Sunrise Rotary clubs\, the annual community
  fundraising event benefits local non-profit initiatives serving Petaluma
  school children\, isolated seniors\, local homeless people as well as Pe
 taluma River enhancement projects.
CATEGORIES:beer,craftbeer,artisinal,livemusic
