SUMMARY: Butter & Egg Days Parade and Festival
DESCRIPTION:2027 Annual Butter & Egg Days Parade and Festival\n\nDate: Sa
 turday\, April 17\, 2027\n\nLocation: Historic Downtown Petaluma\n\nStep 
 into Petaluma's flowering world of curiosity and delight!\n\nThe 2027 But
 ter & Egg Days Parade will take place Saturday\, April 17. Participants a
 nd spectators alike to celebrate the magic and charm of our historic town
 . Colorful floats\, costumed participants\, and lively performances will 
 celebrate Petaluma’s rich history and agricultural heritage. Join in a da
 y of fun and local pride that promises to delight visitors of all ages!\n
 \nThe Butter & Egg Days festivities kick off on Saturday\, April 10 with 
 the Opening Ceremonies at the Petaluma Historical Library and Museum (20 
 4th St)\, from Noon to 1pm. The Mayor will read a proclamation honoring t
 he Grand Marshal and Good Egg. Come enjoy this display that shows the hea
 rt of our community.\n\nOne week later on Saturday\, April 17\, the Butte
 r & Egg Days Parade steps off at noon and will march through the historic
  downtown. The parade will showcase over 100 units with approximately 3\,
 000 participants and 200 volunteers. The Kids’ Parade\, which precedes th
 e main parade at 11:30am with a procession of preschoolers and primary gr
 ade youngsters and their families.\n\nThe Butter & Egg Days Parade is sur
 rounded by a Festival that spreads over four city blocks from 10am-5pm of
 fering a wide variety of food\, crafts\, beverage gardens\, two large kid
  areas\, live music\, and more! This annual event aims to bring together 
 the community for a day of fun and entertainment.\n\nThe following weeken
 d\, Downtown Petaluma continues community celebration with the Annual Spr
 ing Antique Faire\, on Sunday\, April 25.\n\nVisit ButterAndEggDays.com h
 ttp://www.ButterAndEggDays.com for more information.\n\nHappy Butter & Eg
 g Days!!
CATEGORIES:Festival,parade,butter,local,egg,Petaluma,CA,California
