SUMMARY: Petaluma Spring Antique Faire
DESCRIPTION:2027 Petaluma Spring Antique Faire\n\nDate: Sunday\, April 25
 \, 2027\n\nLocation: Historic Downtown Petaluma\n\nThe esteemed Petaluma 
 Spring Antique Faire returns on April 25\, 2027\, from 8am to 4pm\, in Hi
 storic Downtown Petaluma. The Faire is located on Western Ave\, the A Str
 eet Parking lot\, and 4th & Kentucky Streets between B Street and Washing
 ton Street.\n\n"The Bay Area's Premier Antique Center\," Historic Downtow
 n Petaluma will transform into an antique marketplace. Amid the beautiful
  historic buildings\, one-of-a-kind stores\, an incredible array of resta
 urants and cafes\, guests can find an incomparable selection of affordabl
 e antiques from over 200 dealers. The show has a fantastic variety of est
 ate jewelry\, linens\, furniture\, art\, kitchenware\, vintage décor\, bo
 oks\, and all kinds of unusual collectibles to suit everyone's budget.\n\
 nAntique and collectible lovers throughout the Bay Area are welcome to br
 owse and shop the 41st Annual Petaluma Antique Faire set in our delightfu
 l and relaxing downtown Petaluma.\n\nThis show attracts over 8k discernin
 g collectors as well as first-time buyers wishing to collect and invest i
 n real antiques.\n\n\nVisit petalumadowntown.com http://petalumadowntown.
 com\n\n~ Admission is free ~
CATEGORIES:Antiques,Petaluma,CA,California,Vintage,Authentic
